From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bumba <noreply@bumba>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 05:10:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Wake schedulers and grow recipe workers lazily

Poll recipe notifications together with the GNU jobserver, grow each invocation's persistent worker pool only to dispatched concurrency, and allow standalone recipes to write directly to process descriptors.

